/company-news/electronic-arts-ai-summit-2026","publishedAt":"2026-08-02T16:00:00.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-02T16:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-1ibyam3","originalSourceName":"Runway：News（网页）","family":"outlet-7h8g17","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"算力军备竞赛与产业话语权争夺","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsdo0x3203dmro0ovomuyfqx","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-12T02:48:51.643Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1ibyam3","name":"Runway：News（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-12T02:48:51.643Z"}],"sectionLabel":"算力军备竞赛与产业话语权争夺","reportSummary":"EA 首席战略官 Mihir Vaidya 认为，游戏是 AI 的试验场，但生成式 AI 进入游戏面临 60 帧/秒、数千玩家同步和低延迟等严苛约束，不能只追求“看起来真实”，而必须“行为正确”。他主张采用神经符号架构，在生成能力之外保留确定性与可控性，并称“控制是下一个前沿”。EA 将 AI 影响分为效率、扩展和转型三个层面，其中《模拟人生》已服务超 5 亿玩家，拥有近万亿种游玩排列组合。","reportEdition":"2026-08-03","reportKind":"weekly"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsdgioa500wcroca80g0rdcu","title":"Paramount CTO Phil Wiser：AI 属于史上最伟大技术趋势，但“iPhone 时刻”尚未到来","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-08-02T16:00:00.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsdgioa500wcroca80g0rdcu","https://runwayml.com/news/customers/paramount-nyc-summit-2026"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsdgioa500wcroca80g0rdcu","title":"Paramount CTO Phil Wiser：AI 属于史上最伟大技术趋势，但“iPhone 时刻”尚未到来","originalTitle":"","summary":"Paramount 首席技术官 Phil Wiser 认为 AI 应跻身人类史上最伟大技术趋势前五，其影响堪比火的使用。他主张等待依赖条件成熟、以“aha 时刻”引导采用，而非以技术为先导；并警告行业巨头过度分析将错失窗口期，这一窗口可能仅 5 至 10 年。Paramount 两年前已通过 Runway 向全员开放 AI 工具，并以业务成果而非 token 消耗量衡量成效。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsdgioa500wcroca80g0rdcu","originalUrl":"https://runwayml.com/news/customers/paramount-nyc-summit-2026","publishedAt":"2026-08-02T16:00:00.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-02T16:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-1ibyam3","originalSourceName":"Runway：News（网页）","family":"outlet-7h8g17","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"算力军备竞赛与产业话语权争夺","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsdgioa500wcroca80g0rdcu","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-12T02:48:51.643Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1ibyam3","name":"Runway：News（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-12T02:48:51.643Z"}],"sectionLabel":"算力军备竞赛与产业话语权争夺","reportSummary":"Paramount 首席技术官 Phil Wiser 认为 AI 应跻身人类史上最伟大技术趋势前五，其影响堪比火的使用。他主张等待依赖条件成熟、以“aha 时刻”引导采用，而非以技术为先导；并警告行业巨头过度分析将错失窗口期，这一窗口可能仅 5 至 10 年。Paramount 两年前已通过 Runway 向全员开放 AI 工具，并以业务成果而非 token 消耗量衡量成效。","reportEdition":"2026-08-03","reportKind":"weekly"}],"total":21,"partial":false,"itemSourceCount":15,"topics":[{"topic":"模型","count":6},{"topic":"应用","count":15}],"method":"AIHOT 提供选题、摘要与编排；模境保留来源与报告窗口，关联模型数据。原报道与模型评测分别核对，不将资讯排名当作能力评分。"}}
